    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Fistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502172903\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fistarqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Fistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502172903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"932\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fistarqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fistarqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eDrunken Master\u003c/b\u003e \n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA martial arts master who performs impredictable striking techniques with the spirit of sake in her body.boda.\nOriginally, she invoked the spirit of sake for a performance promoting a local brew and rose to fame as a beautiful fighter.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/5d/SFistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502173112\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"SFistarqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/5d/SFistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502173112\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"980\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SFistarqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SFistarqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dd/Fistar_DM_Bartender_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251217232715\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fistar DM Bartender Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"